  m_Text: To figure out the relative path, we can use a simple method involving the
    absolute paths of our current location and target location. First, we find the
    latest name that is in both. In this case, this is B1. Then, we add a ".." to
    the start of the relative path for every name after B1 in the current path. Finally,
    we add everthing that appears in the target path after B1.
