  m_Text: 'Only one part of your training left now, using the real file system. You''ll
    notice that a new button has appeared on the left side of the screen. If you
    click on it, it will open the file explorer of your computer. It should look
    something like the image below, although the actual files and folders will be
    different.


    Note that you are in a folder named "play_area". While there
    are folders before that one, you should treat "play_area" as the root folder
    for what we''ll do today.'
