  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Oh, hey! You must be the new recruit! Looking forward to working with you. Unfortunately,
    we can't get into things just yet. First, you need to complete some simple training.
  - Go ahead and go over to the console over there and press E to interact with it.
    Once you finish the training there we'll be able to move on.
