  m_Text: Another option is to go from where you are right now, on B7. To do this,
    you need to go back to the branch that holds B7. We can denote this special "move
    backwards" action with a special name, "..". Any time your ant encounters a "..",
    it will move to the branch that holds what it's currently standing on.
