    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.4
  m_Text: Let's say that you want to eat L3. To get there, you first have to start
    at B1, since that's the only part touching the ground. Then you would go to B7,
    then B8, and finally to L3. You've probably noticed that that's a lot to write
    out. Fortunately, there's a cleaner formatting that can be used.
