  m_Text: As an ant, you want to get to the leaves on the tree. Unfortunately, you're
    a bit picky, and only want to eat specific leaves. In order to get to a specific
    leaf, you need to know what branches to climb in order to get there. Unfortunately,
    because you are so small, you can only see branches and leaves attached to the
    branch you're standing on.
